                              BigDecimal energyKwh, Instant recordedAt,
                              String requestId, Instant createdAt) {
    }

    private static final RowMapper<SnapshotRow> MAPPER = (rs, n) -> new SnapshotRow(
            rs.getLong("id"),
            rs.getString("session_no"),
            rs.getInt("reading_seq"),
